WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 23=

5
01:40.620 --> 01:41.740
A little stone stele

6
01:41.740 --> 01:43.260
hardly conveys my sincerity.

7
01:43.940 --> 01:44.900
I've already ordered

8
01:45.260 --> 01:47.780
my 100,000 Central Circuit troops at the border

9
01:50.020 --> 01:51.180
to join me in wishing Your Majesty

10
01:51.820 --> 01:53.140
a long and prosperous reign.

11
01:53.340 --> 01:53.900
This...

12
01:54.540 --> 01:55.020
How...

13
02:10.700 --> 02:11.900
General, I appreciate

14
02:13.100 --> 02:14.020
the gesture.

15
02:17.340 --> 02:18.540
Forgive my boldness, Your Majesty.

16
02:24.980 --> 02:25.860
May I

17
02:26.420 --> 02:27.460
take a look at that tablet?

18
02:31.580 --> 02:32.060
Your Majesty,

19
02:33.340 --> 02:34.020
perhaps

20
02:35.100 --> 02:37.020
we should let Scholar Yan have a try.

21
02:38.020 --> 02:38.380
Very well.

22
02:42.020 --> 02:42.340
Yan Shang!

23
02:54.500 --> 02:55.940
The inscription on General Meng's tablet

24
02:56.460 --> 02:58.420
has faded with age.

25
02:59.060 --> 02:59.700
However,

26
03:00.260 --> 03:02.620
I've studied regional scripts since childhood

27
03:02.980 --> 03:03.740
and know a little about them.

28
03:04.340 --> 03:04.860
Perhaps

29
03:05.700 --> 03:07.220
I could try reading it aloud.

30
03:09.540 --> 03:09.980
Your Majesty,

31
03:10.900 --> 03:11.540
why not

32
03:12.660 --> 03:15.180
let the third-place scholar give it a try?

33
03:17.820 --> 03:18.180
Very well.

34
03:32.060 --> 03:33.180
No wonder General Meng said

35
03:33.180 --> 03:34.860
this tablet was a hundred years old.

36
03:35.820 --> 03:36.500
He was right.

37
03:37.420 --> 03:37.900
This is

38
03:38.580 --> 03:40.140
an imperial edict from a century ago,

39
03:40.420 --> 03:43.420
issued by Emperor Shengzu, founder of Huai.

40
03:51.580 --> 03:53.340
"Compared to Huai,

41
03:54.300 --> 03:55.260
the Central Circuit is but a single prefecture.

42
03:55.980 --> 03:58.700
You should respect our might and appreciate our mercy,

43
03:58.900 --> 04:00.140
and seek peace rather than conflict.

44
04:00.700 --> 04:02.300
Otherwise, when our imperial army marches,

45
04:02.500 --> 04:03.620
blood will flow for miles.

46
04:04.380 --> 04:06.660
Our emperor, in his boundless mercy,

47
04:07.300 --> 04:08.660
has forgiven your insolence.

48
04:09.260 --> 04:09.900
You would

49
04:10.740 --> 04:11.700
do well to think twice!"

50
04:14.260 --> 04:15.420
Brilliant!

51
04:15.540 --> 04:16.460
Absolutely...

52
04:16.860 --> 04:17.820
Absolutely brilliant!

53
04:17.820 --> 04:18.940
What a joke!

54
04:25.420 --> 04:27.620
Back then, the Meng ancestors pledged allegiance and paid tribute.

55
04:27.820 --> 04:29.700
That's when Emperor Shengzu issued this edict.

56
04:30.060 --> 04:33.180
He even displayed their letter of surrender atop Shenwu Gate.

57
04:33.900 --> 04:34.380
Today,

58
04:35.020 --> 04:36.820
your 100,000 troops are far away in the Central Circuit,

59
04:37.540 --> 04:38.540
but that letter of surrender

60
04:39.140 --> 04:40.700
is right here in Taiji Palace.

61
04:41.420 --> 04:43.300
Would you care to see it, General Meng?

62
04:43.980 --> 04:44.620
That won't be necessary.

63
04:50.020 --> 04:50.460
Enough.

64
04:51.420 --> 04:53.380
There's no need to bring up the past.

65
04:54.020 --> 04:56.860
General, don't take it to heart.

66
04:57.380 --> 04:59.660
Yan, despite your young age,

67
05:00.660 --> 05:02.980
you're already a scholar of remarkable learning.

68
05:03.660 --> 05:04.140
Bring him a seat.

69
05:06.060 --> 05:07.180
Thank you, Your Majesty.

70
05:18.220 --> 05:19.300
Could you really read those characters?

71
05:20.980 --> 05:21.820
Not a single one.

72
05:23.820 --> 05:24.900
You've got some nerve.

73
05:25.260 --> 05:27.060
North Jing joined the Central Plains dynasties ages ago.

74
05:27.460 --> 05:28.740
They've long shared our language and script.

75
05:29.100 --> 05:30.900
Before that, they had a spoken language but no script.

76
05:31.300 --> 05:32.380
How could they have a script of their own?

77
05:44.580 --> 05:45.020
Your Majesty,

78
05:45.740 --> 05:47.140
since you're pleased with my gift,

79
05:47.860 --> 05:49.340
I have another favor to ask.

80
05:50.020 --> 05:51.020
Go ahead, General.

81
05:51.660 --> 05:53.620
When Princess Danyang married into North Jing,

82
05:54.420 --> 05:56.140
it was a great honor you bestowed on my uncle.

83
05:57.420 --> 05:59.340
Now that I've succeeded him as military governor of the Central Circuit,

84
05:59.940 --> 06:00.860
I'd like to ask Your Majesty

85
06:01.500 --> 06:02.780
to grant me the same honor.

86
06:03.420 --> 06:04.580
General, are you asking...

87
06:05.340 --> 06:06.580
By North Jing custom,

88
06:08.300 --> 06:09.460
a wife follows her husband in death,

89
06:10.100 --> 06:11.140
and a son succeeds his father.

90
06:12.180 --> 06:13.700
My uncle raised me like his own son.

91
06:14.420 --> 06:15.300
So I beg Your Majesty

92
06:16.140 --> 06:18.060
to grant me Princess Danyang's hand.

93
06:36.820 --> 06:37.300
Father,

94
06:38.020 --> 06:39.460
since this concerns my marriage,

95
06:40.340 --> 06:41.380
I have something to say.

96
06:42.580 --> 06:42.900
Speak.

97
06:43.460 --> 06:44.620
I'm not opposed to marrying again.

98
06:45.300 --> 06:47.060
But I spent quite some time in North Jing,

99
06:47.500 --> 06:48.500
so I know a few of their customs.

100
06:49.300 --> 06:50.340
The northerners value martial skill.

101
06:51.100 --> 06:53.140
A suitor often has to fight for a bride's hand.

102
06:53.620 --> 06:55.340
Only the winner earns the right to marry her.

103
06:58.220 --> 06:59.220
And whom would you like me

104
06:59.620 --> 07:01.420
to challenge, Princess Danyang?

105
07:02.140 --> 07:03.780
It's the perfect time for a hunt.

106
07:04.660 --> 07:05.900
Since General Meng has made his request,

107
07:07.100 --> 07:08.300
why not have him compete

108
07:09.020 --> 07:10.540
with the other suitors here?

109
07:11.300 --> 07:12.540
Whoever wins,

110
07:12.980 --> 07:15.140
I'll marry him.

111
07:23.180 --> 07:23.820
Wanyao,

112
07:24.460 --> 07:26.060
have you thought this through?

113
07:27.540 --> 07:28.900
Please grant me this, Father.

114
07:32.140 --> 07:32.500
Very well.

115
07:34.180 --> 07:35.540
Winter has been rather dull.

116
07:36.500 --> 07:37.540
This should liven things up.

117
07:38.300 --> 07:40.780
Warriors from every territory may join the hunt.

118
07:41.260 --> 07:44.060
And if it leads to an extraordinary marriage,

119
07:44.900 --> 07:47.060
that would make quite a story.

120
07:55.420 --> 07:57.260
If you gentlemen truly wish to compete against me,

121
07:58.300 --> 07:59.660
I'll gladly accept the challenge.

122
08:00.980 --> 08:02.740
But there's something you should know first,

123
08:03.180 --> 08:05.620
so you won't feel cheated after the contest

124
08:06.420 --> 08:07.860
and regret all that effort.

125
08:09.300 --> 08:10.580
You may not be aware,

126
08:11.020 --> 08:11.820
but Princess Danyang

127
08:13.700 --> 08:15.820
once had an abortion in North Jing.

128
08:17.980 --> 08:18.740
She'll never

129
08:19.060 --> 08:20.740
be able to bear children again.

130
08:34.900 --> 08:35.980
Now that you know the truth,

131
08:37.860 --> 08:39.700
does anyone still want to challenge me?

132
08:44.020 --> 08:44.380
Your Majesty,

133
08:45.100 --> 08:47.780
I'd like to challenge General Meng!

134
08:50.580 --> 08:50.940
Your Majesty,

135
08:51.380 --> 08:52.140
I'd like to compete too!

136
08:52.700 --> 08:53.700
Unbelievable!

137
08:54.740 --> 08:55.780
You're a woman.

138
08:56.860 --> 08:57.860
You want to marry the Princess too?

139
08:58.540 --> 08:59.260
I'm not doing this for the Princess.

140
09:00.020 --> 09:00.660
I'm competing

141
09:01.180 --> 09:02.260
to show everyone

142
09:02.700 --> 09:03.980
whether you people of North Jing

143
09:04.420 --> 09:05.860
are as brave as we are in Sheng'an!

144
09:06.020 --> 09:06.820
Mind your manners!

145
09:09.140 --> 09:09.660
General Meng,

146
09:10.460 --> 09:11.900
my daughter is young and headstrong.

147
09:12.380 --> 09:13.200
(Zhao Zongze, Zhao Lingfei's Father) Please don't take offense.

148
09:13.200 --> 09:14.140
(General of the Left Imperial Guard) Please don't take offense.

149
09:16.420 --> 09:16.980
General Zhao,

150
09:17.460 --> 09:20.380
your daughter has shown admirable spirit.

151
09:20.940 --> 09:21.420
Your Majesty,

152
09:21.820 --> 09:22.900
why not let her compete?

153
09:25.660 --> 09:26.100
Permission granted.

154
09:26.980 --> 09:27.460
Your Majesty,

155
09:29.380 --> 09:31.540
I have a young officer under my command

156
09:31.780 --> 09:32.980
named Jian Hua.

157
09:33.740 --> 09:34.860
He's young and handsome,

158
09:35.180 --> 09:36.140
with exceptional fighting skills.

159
09:36.740 --> 09:37.900
He'd be a worthy match for the Princess.

160
09:38.420 --> 09:39.460
(Mu Xianqing, Military Governor) He could compete as well.

161
09:40.140 --> 09:40.620
Your Majesty,

162
09:42.740 --> 09:44.940
(Qiu Shuo, General of Tiger Might) I'd like to join the winter hunt too!

163
09:54.980 --> 09:56.740
Since Zhao Lingfei is allowed to compete,

164
09:57.780 --> 09:58.980
I suppose this competition

165
09:59.580 --> 10:00.540
isn't just about marrying Wanyao.

166
10:01.780 --> 10:03.100
And as Wanyao's older brother,

167
10:04.660 --> 10:05.820
I'd also like to test

168
10:06.620 --> 10:07.780
General Meng's fighting skills.

169
10:07.980 --> 10:08.660
Excellent!

170
10:09.980 --> 10:12.020
With even the Crown Prince joining us,

171
10:12.500 --> 10:14.060
whether I win or lose,

172
10:14.620 --> 10:16.100
this trip will have been worthwhile.

173
10:16.420 --> 10:17.500
Since it's a competition,

174
10:18.340 --> 10:20.620
we should establish the rules first.

175
10:21.340 --> 10:21.940
Why don't we

176
10:22.980 --> 10:24.780
tie a golden bell around a deer's neck?

177
10:25.420 --> 10:27.860
All who signed up today will hunt it.

178
10:28.300 --> 10:29.340
Whoever claims the deer

179
10:29.820 --> 10:33.020
will decide whom Princess Danyang marries.

180
10:33.700 --> 10:34.180
How does that sound?

181
10:36.980 --> 10:37.500
Father,

182
10:38.860 --> 10:40.220
it seems I have no choice but to compete too.

183
10:43.780 --> 10:45.220
It seems Princess Danyang

184
10:45.540 --> 10:49.220
is determined to have a say in her own marriage.

185
10:54.980 --> 10:55.660
Cheng'an,

186
10:56.660 --> 10:58.100
let's give her that chance.

187
10:59.180 --> 11:00.460
As Your Majesty wishes.

188
11:02.540 --> 11:03.020
Very well.

189
11:05.700 --> 11:06.660
Ten days from now,

190
11:07.020 --> 11:08.460
we'll hold a winter hunt at the royal hunting grounds.

191
11:09.020 --> 11:11.180
All those who've signed up,

192
11:11.380 --> 11:13.500
along with the promising young people of Sheng'an,

193
11:13.780 --> 11:14.700
may participate.

194
11:15.340 --> 11:16.420
I'm curious to see

195
11:17.340 --> 11:17.940
who will

196
11:18.980 --> 11:19.660
ultimately

197
11:21.180 --> 11:23.020
claim the deer.

198
11:25.460 --> 11:27.660
Your Majesty is wise!

199
11:43.980 --> 11:48.100
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

200
11:48.300 --> 11:50.820
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

201
11:50.980 --> 11:54.500
♪Cold as a blade, yet peerless as a bloom♪

202
11:54.820 --> 11:58.340
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

203
11:58.380 --> 12:02.620
♪With sacrificed innocence and a soul snowbound♪

204
12:02.740 --> 12:05.220
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

205
12:05.380 --> 12:08.460
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

206
12:08.580 --> 12:11.700
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

207
12:12.380 --> 12:16.420
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

208
12:16.940 --> 12:19.740
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

209
12:19.820 --> 12:26.020
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers bright as day for you♪

210
12:26.660 --> 12:30.460
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

211
12:30.580 --> 12:33.660
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

212
12:33.900 --> 12:38.120
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

213
12:38.120 --> 12:42.740
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

214
12:43.540 --> 12:47.340
♪They gave me this life without asking me♪

215
12:47.820 --> 12:50.900
♪If I can't decide what to do with it♪

216
12:51.140 --> 12:57.500
♪I might as well use it to light a fire and burn the darkness into daylight♪

217
12:57.860 --> 13:01.660
♪You're my princess, and I'll take you away♪

218
13:01.780 --> 13:04.860
♪In this life, we'll bow only to flowers♪

219
13:05.100 --> 13:10.940
♪Fierce and radiant, red lips and dark eyes♪

220
13:11.220 --> 13:15.260
♪Together we'll climb the city walls♪

221
13:19.420 --> 13:21.780
How can we examine her if she won't let us in?

222
13:21.780 --> 13:23.060
We still have to report back!

223
13:23.300 --> 13:24.100
Exactly!

224
13:24.100 --> 13:24.580
Of course!

225
13:26.260 --> 13:26.940
Who's that?

226
13:27.660 --> 13:28.740
What's he doing here?

227
13:28.940 --> 13:29.780
No idea.

228
13:29.900 --> 13:34.080
♪Mourn the blooms of youth; Mourn my bridal hair♪

229
13:34.080 --> 13:38.420
♪Mourn the blooms of youth; Mourn my bridal hair♪

230
13:39.700 --> 13:40.100
Your Highness.

231
13:40.820 --> 13:41.340
It's me.

232
13:47.460 --> 13:47.940
Your Highness.

233
14:18.220 --> 14:18.700
You're drunk.

234
14:51.900 --> 14:52.740
Did you see them?

235
14:55.020 --> 14:55.980
Those people outside

236
14:57.180 --> 14:58.140
include Lord Yu's men

237
14:59.380 --> 15:00.340
and the Crown Prince's.

238
15:03.100 --> 15:04.980
They claim they're here for a routine checkup.

239
15:09.860 --> 15:12.340
It's only been a few hours since Meng Zaishi said those things.

240
15:13.460 --> 15:14.940
They couldn't even wait one night

241
15:15.700 --> 15:16.780
to find out if he was telling the truth.

242
15:21.460 --> 15:21.980
What about you?

243
15:23.860 --> 15:24.300
Yan Shang.

244
15:26.140 --> 15:27.380
Don't you have anything you want to ask me?

245
15:55.980 --> 15:57.100
There's only one thing I want to ask.

246
15:58.900 --> 16:00.460
Should we curse Meng Zaishi first,

247
16:02.180 --> 16:03.340
or your brother?

248
16:05.020 --> 16:05.900
I'll curse them right along with you.

249
16:18.780 --> 16:19.780
What he said was true.

250
16:25.300 --> 16:26.700
I can't have children anymore.

251
16:34.860 --> 16:35.380
What a coincidence.

252
16:37.620 --> 16:39.540
A fortune teller once told me, when I was little,

253
16:40.780 --> 16:42.580
that I was destined to have no children.

254
16:47.740 --> 16:49.260
I was worried you'd reject me over it.

255
16:50.380 --> 16:50.740
Who knew

256
16:52.340 --> 16:53.660
we'd end up in the same boat?

257
17:03.340 --> 17:03.740
Your Highness,

258
17:05.540 --> 17:07.300
I'll never let you marry Meng Zaishi.

259
17:09.380 --> 17:09.820
All right.

260
17:10.940 --> 17:12.180
I'll keep rising through the ranks

261
17:14.740 --> 17:16.620
until I can be your bargaining chip,

262
17:19.060 --> 17:20.700
so no one can ever control you again.

263
17:43.500 --> 17:43.940
Yan Shang.

264
17:48.580 --> 17:49.220
Thank you.

265
17:59.020 --> 17:59.500
Your Highness,

266
18:01.020 --> 18:01.780
between you and me,

267
18:03.940 --> 18:04.500
there's no need for thanks.

268
18:11.620 --> 18:12.220
Don't worry.

269
18:14.580 --> 18:15.820
I'll take good care of myself.

270
18:20.740 --> 18:21.780
(If I could kill once,)

271
18:23.060 --> 18:24.220
(I can kill again.)

272
18:25.900 --> 18:26.980
(Meng Zaishi's neck)

273
18:27.780 --> 18:29.460
(can't be any tougher than his uncle's.)

274
18:32.220 --> 18:32.980
(But Yan Shang,)

275
18:34.540 --> 18:36.660
(I can't drag you into this danger.)

276
18:40.540 --> 18:40.940
(Your Highness,)

277
18:42.900 --> 18:44.380
(do you want Meng Zaishi dead?)

278
18:46.420 --> 18:47.780
(I'll find a way to make it happen.)

279
18:50.180 --> 18:50.900
(Those hands of yours)

280
18:52.420 --> 18:53.900
(should never have to do that again.)

281
19:14.620 --> 19:15.500
Forgive us, Your Royal Highness.

282
19:15.940 --> 19:17.260
We couldn't see the Princess.

283
19:17.460 --> 19:18.540
We were turned away.

284
19:31.700 --> 19:33.740
You drank plenty at the banquet.

285
19:34.700 --> 19:35.060
What?

286
19:35.900 --> 19:36.860
Planning to drink yourself into a stupor again?

287
19:45.820 --> 19:47.220
Before she left for North Jing,

288
19:48.900 --> 19:50.140
we told each other everything.

289
19:50.780 --> 19:52.020
Then we spent three years apart.

290
19:52.900 --> 19:53.660
When we met again,

291
19:55.700 --> 19:57.060
she didn't say a word

292
19:57.540 --> 19:58.500
about what happened in North Jing.

293
20:03.980 --> 20:05.740
It's not just that she no longer wants to marry me.

294
20:07.100 --> 20:09.060
She doesn't even see me as a friend anymore.

295
20:09.980 --> 20:11.060
And it took me until today

296
20:11.820 --> 20:12.620
to realize that.

297
20:18.140 --> 20:19.100
You're reading too much into it.

298
20:19.980 --> 20:20.780
If she really

299
20:21.820 --> 20:22.940
went through something like that,

300
20:24.020 --> 20:25.420
of course she wouldn't want to tell her friends and family.

301
20:29.700 --> 20:30.140
Since she won't let

302
20:30.700 --> 20:31.940
the imperial physicians near her,

303
20:33.460 --> 20:34.060
I think

304
20:35.020 --> 20:35.820
I have my answer.

305
20:37.380 --> 20:37.740
Yang Si,

306
20:38.140 --> 20:40.100
go to her residence tomorrow.

307
20:40.740 --> 20:42.620
Find out everything you can about this.

308
20:50.900 --> 20:51.380
Your Highness,

309
20:57.180 --> 20:58.420
you're even more heartless

310
21:00.140 --> 21:01.500
than I thought.

311
21:07.340 --> 21:08.940
You and I may not believe the prophecy about her,

312
21:09.820 --> 21:10.940
but plenty of others do.

313
21:11.940 --> 21:13.580
Whether she can bear a future ruler

314
21:14.780 --> 21:16.060
matters to a great many people.

315
21:16.340 --> 21:17.780
The fate of the empire is at stake.

316
21:18.380 --> 21:19.620
Why are you getting so worked up?

317
21:20.580 --> 21:21.460
Stop playing the devoted lover.

318
21:24.340 --> 21:25.620
She's your sister, for God's sake!

319
21:41.620 --> 21:42.340
As...

320
21:43.300 --> 21:43.900
you command,

321
21:46.580 --> 21:47.060
Your Royal Highness.

322
21:51.380 --> 21:53.780
(Hongwen Hall; Pursuit of Wisdom; Quiet Contemplation)

323
22:08.020 --> 22:10.580
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing)

324
22:11.580 --> 22:12.780
(Of all these people,)

325
22:13.620 --> 22:14.980
(I suspect only Meng Zaishi)

326
22:14.980 --> 22:16.780
(truly has his heart set on that deer.)

327
22:17.700 --> 22:20.620
(Shi)

328
22:22.220 --> 22:24.060
(Qing)

329
22:24.060 --> 22:25.100
(Mu Xianqing.)

330
22:26.020 --> 22:27.140
(Would he rather claim the deer,)

331
22:28.020 --> 22:30.180
(or take Meng Zaishi's life?)

332
22:31.180 --> 22:32.780
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing) (Which would please him more?)

333
22:34.380 --> 22:35.620
(Qiu Shuo joined the hunt)

334
22:36.140 --> 22:37.580
(on Yu Cheng'an's orders.)

335
22:38.700 --> 22:40.380
(What exactly is Yu Cheng'an planning?)

336
22:41.580 --> 22:42.340
(Could it be...)

337
22:43.260 --> 22:44.540
(The Crown Prince might be in danger?)

338
22:46.780 --> 22:48.140
(But why would the Crown Prince)

339
22:48.140 --> 22:49.700
(volunteer to take part?)

340
22:51.180 --> 22:52.700
(He's always kept his abilities hidden)

341
22:53.420 --> 22:55.740
(and never dared show his strength before Lord Yu.)

342
22:57.460 --> 22:58.660
(Why step into the spotlight now?)

343
23:00.580 --> 23:02.220
(Xun) (What's he really after?)

344
23:06.660 --> 23:09.180
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing)

345
23:10.940 --> 23:11.300
Yan Shang.

346
23:11.300 --> 23:12.020
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing)

347
23:13.540 --> 23:13.820
What...

348
23:14.460 --> 23:15.260
are you writing?

349
23:18.100 --> 23:18.860
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing) Aren't these

350
23:19.340 --> 23:21.260
the most powerful figures at court right now?

351
23:22.940 --> 23:25.220
You can't just write their names down like that!

352
23:27.140 --> 23:29.180
I was thinking about tomorrow's winter hunt.

353
23:29.580 --> 23:31.060
We're accompanying His Majesty,

354
23:31.780 --> 23:32.780
and these powerful men

355
23:32.980 --> 23:34.220
are usually way out of our reach.

356
23:34.820 --> 23:36.940
If I could bring a gift and use this opportunity,

357
23:37.660 --> 23:39.700
which one should I approach?

358
23:40.980 --> 23:41.380
Cui Ren,

359
23:41.900 --> 23:42.820
give me some advice.

360
23:45.220 --> 23:46.180
You're getting ahead of yourself.

361
23:47.220 --> 23:50.260
They search you from head to toe before you enter the hunting grounds.

362
23:50.340 --> 23:51.740
They even check inside your topknot.

363
23:51.780 --> 23:52.940
You won't get anything past them.

364
23:54.700 --> 23:55.420
Besides,

365
23:56.020 --> 23:56.580
these men

366
23:57.300 --> 23:59.620
are all far too powerful for us to cozy up to.

367
24:02.660 --> 24:03.380
Then again,

368
24:04.540 --> 24:05.500
you're different.

369
24:06.500 --> 24:08.540
Why not use your connections with Princess Danyang?

370
24:10.580 --> 24:11.300
Cui Ren...

371
24:13.060 --> 24:13.740
Look at you.

372
24:14.140 --> 24:15.220
You've already got every advantage,

373
24:15.700 --> 24:17.460
yet you're still racking your brains to advance your career.

374
24:17.820 --> 24:19.980
How are the rest of us, just collecting our salaries, supposed to get by?

375
24:33.540 --> 24:34.300
You don't have to feel awkward.

376
24:36.660 --> 24:37.540
I'll tell you myself.

377
24:40.100 --> 24:40.980
What Meng said

378
24:41.500 --> 24:42.100
was all true.

379
24:43.860 --> 24:44.380
Wanyao...

380
24:46.220 --> 24:47.500
Now you know everything.

381
24:48.100 --> 24:48.620
You can leave.

382
24:51.500 --> 24:52.580
I have a question of my own.

383
24:56.620 --> 24:57.460
If I claim the deer,

384
24:59.340 --> 25:00.420
who would you want to belong to?

385
25:01.340 --> 25:02.620
I only want to belong to myself.

386
25:06.580 --> 25:07.260
When it comes to archery and riding,

387
25:08.220 --> 25:09.300
even against Meng Zaishi,

388
25:09.900 --> 25:10.900
I'd still stand a chance.

389
25:12.460 --> 25:12.980
Don't worry.

390
25:13.820 --> 25:14.620
I'll help you. I promise.

391
25:19.100 --> 25:19.700
Your Highness!

392
25:24.660 --> 25:26.020
Yang Si, you're here too!

393
25:28.180 --> 25:28.580
Zhi.

394
25:30.780 --> 25:31.580
What's the dog for?

395
25:32.420 --> 25:33.460
I asked her to come.

396
25:35.740 --> 25:37.020
I've brought Your Highness a prized hunting dog

397
25:37.100 --> 25:37.780
to help you hunt the deer.

398
25:39.420 --> 25:40.100
Lingfei,

399
25:40.980 --> 25:43.060
thank you for standing up for me at the birthday banquet.

400
25:43.420 --> 25:45.220
And now you've come to my rescue again.

401
25:46.220 --> 25:46.940
I just couldn't stand

402
25:46.940 --> 25:48.140
that brutish soldier from North Jing.

403
25:48.500 --> 25:49.860
I just spoke up in the heat of the moment.

404
25:50.180 --> 25:51.300
I've always been quick to speak my mind.

405
25:51.500 --> 25:52.340
I hardly did anything.

406
25:52.580 --> 25:53.420
Please don't mention it again, Your Highness.

407
25:54.740 --> 25:55.180
Zhi.

408
25:55.980 --> 25:56.300
Sniff.

409
26:00.140 --> 26:00.700
Here's some dried meat.

410
26:01.860 --> 26:02.300
Zhi.

411
26:07.700 --> 26:08.060
Go on.

412
26:20.060 --> 26:21.220
I found this forehead ornament when I came in.

413
26:21.500 --> 26:22.660
Looks like it belongs to this lady.

414
26:23.340 --> 26:23.980
Here you go.

415
26:27.020 --> 26:27.740
Thank you, Miss.

416
26:33.020 --> 26:33.940
Is there a way

417
26:34.460 --> 26:36.580
to keep Zhi from rushing straight at a target,

418
26:37.100 --> 26:39.260
and have her follow at a distance

419
26:39.620 --> 26:40.620
without the prey noticing?

420
26:41.100 --> 26:41.740
You mean tracking?

421
26:42.260 --> 26:43.620
Then give her this command.

422
26:44.740 --> 26:45.060
Track!

423
26:46.260 --> 26:46.580
Track!

424
26:49.420 --> 26:50.900
Lingfei, thank you so much.

425
26:52.100 --> 26:54.940
I heard Lord Yu arranged for the deer and golden bell.

426
26:55.540 --> 26:57.060
They've already been taken to the hunting grounds.

427
26:57.420 --> 26:57.820
Your Highness,

428
26:58.140 --> 26:58.620
Yang Si,

429
26:59.140 --> 27:00.180
could you two get

430
27:00.180 --> 27:01.500
some droppings from that deer?

431
27:02.100 --> 27:02.820
A few hairs would work too.

432
27:03.620 --> 27:04.700
Or failing that,

433
27:04.940 --> 27:06.060
even some straw from its pen.

434
27:06.620 --> 27:07.180
No problem.

435
27:08.180 --> 27:08.460
Here.

436
27:21.020 --> 27:21.580
Stop!

437
27:23.260 --> 27:23.660
Mr. Chen.

438
27:25.340 --> 27:26.380
Oh, it's you, Wenji.

439
27:27.660 --> 27:28.620
What brings you here?

440
27:29.740 --> 27:31.860
This is a special Golden Bell Crisp from the Imperial Cuisine Service.

441
27:32.420 --> 27:33.900
I was ordered to deliver it to Lord Yu.

442
27:53.460 --> 27:55.140
Could you present it to him for me?

443
27:55.620 --> 27:56.100
That would be just as good.

444
28:05.060 --> 28:05.940
Why'd you spill it?

445
28:06.540 --> 28:07.580
You clumsy fool!

446
28:07.580 --> 28:08.460
Clean it up, now!

447
28:08.740 --> 28:10.500
If you get Lord Yu's shoes dirty,

448
28:10.780 --> 28:11.660
you'll pay for it!

449
28:33.300 --> 28:35.260
How are things with the Prince of Jin lately?

450
28:36.460 --> 28:37.220
Everything is as usual.

451
28:39.980 --> 28:42.620
Is his secondary consort's pregnancy progressing well?

452
28:44.220 --> 28:47.220
The imperial physician checks her pulse every ten days.

453
28:48.780 --> 28:52.220
But there have been unusual developments at the Eastern Palace lately.

454
28:53.300 --> 28:53.780
Who's there?

455
28:56.460 --> 28:57.020
Lord Yu,

456
28:58.340 --> 29:00.340
I was only here by chance.

457
29:00.620 --> 29:01.660
I never meant to eavesdrop.

458
29:03.140 --> 29:03.980
But just now,

459
29:04.140 --> 29:06.100
I did overhear you and Mr. Wei.

460
29:06.580 --> 29:07.340
I won't deny it.

461
29:08.220 --> 29:09.100
I know I deserve to die.

462
29:09.820 --> 29:10.860
I leave my fate in your hands.

463
29:27.500 --> 29:27.900
Enough.

464
29:28.460 --> 29:28.860
Stop trembling.

465
29:30.060 --> 29:31.620
If I wanted you dead, you'd be dead already.

466
29:33.740 --> 29:37.860
(Hidden Talent and Virtue)

467
29:39.860 --> 29:40.500
Thank you, Lord Yu.

468
29:41.300 --> 29:42.220
You're a man

469
29:43.860 --> 29:44.460
of learning,

470
29:45.460 --> 29:46.540
and you're quick-witted.

471
29:47.500 --> 29:48.580
But understand this.

472
29:48.980 --> 29:50.780
To survive here,

473
29:51.220 --> 29:52.420
you must listen more and talk less.

474
29:53.220 --> 29:55.020
That's how you'll secure your future.

475
29:56.540 --> 29:58.340
I'll take your advice to heart, Lord Yu.

476
29:59.660 --> 30:01.580
My lips will be sealed.

477
30:12.260 --> 30:12.580
Lord Yu.

478
30:14.220 --> 30:15.380
Chen Lian

479
30:16.100 --> 30:17.180
has always been a bully.

480
30:18.020 --> 30:18.820
Don't dwell

481
30:19.780 --> 30:20.540
on what happened tonight.

482
30:22.580 --> 30:24.380
I'm fortunate to have your favor, Lord Yu.

483
30:25.740 --> 30:26.540
Things like this

484
30:27.740 --> 30:28.420
are bound to happen.

485
30:29.860 --> 30:30.820
You know,

486
30:33.620 --> 30:36.020
eunuchs have all had hard lives.

487
30:37.540 --> 30:38.780
(Hidden Talent and Virtue) Those who've suffered

488
30:40.260 --> 30:43.100
shouldn't look down on or undermine one another.

489
30:43.780 --> 30:44.900
But you must understand,

490
30:45.980 --> 30:46.860
how many people

491
30:47.420 --> 30:48.660
can truly live by that?

492
30:51.460 --> 30:52.100
I understand, Lord Yu.

493
30:54.980 --> 30:57.460
Have you ever thought about leaving the Imperial Cuisine Service?

494
31:00.860 --> 31:02.260
Whether I can leave there

495
31:02.700 --> 31:03.940
is entirely up to you, Lord Yu.

496
31:04.460 --> 31:04.940
Since

497
31:05.540 --> 31:06.580
you haven't given the word yet,

498
31:07.460 --> 31:08.180
I...

499
31:10.500 --> 31:11.540
I would venture to guess

500
31:12.140 --> 31:13.100
that you wish to

501
31:13.460 --> 31:14.820
test and train me further.

502
31:20.980 --> 31:22.220
I remember you telling me

503
31:22.780 --> 31:23.620
that you once

504
31:24.380 --> 31:26.100
planned to take the imperial examinations.

505
31:27.220 --> 31:28.420
But something happened,

506
31:29.100 --> 31:30.420
and you became a eunuch instead.

507
31:31.100 --> 31:31.900
What happened?

508
31:33.060 --> 31:33.820
Your family fell on hard times?

509
31:46.260 --> 31:46.620
One day,

510
31:48.420 --> 31:49.660
I came across a young woman

511
31:50.380 --> 31:51.220
being bullied by a thug.

512
31:52.700 --> 31:53.380
I couldn't stand it,

513
31:54.580 --> 31:55.380
so I stepped in to reason with him.

514
31:57.260 --> 31:58.300
But the thug

515
31:59.260 --> 32:00.500
attacked me with a knife and mutilated me.

516
32:03.060 --> 32:04.060
Was the attacker

517
32:04.740 --> 32:06.140
brought to justice?

518
32:07.380 --> 32:07.780
Yes, Lord Yu.

519
32:09.220 --> 32:09.820
Justice caught up with him.

520
32:10.540 --> 32:10.940
That man

521
32:11.580 --> 32:12.900
got what he deserved.

522
32:13.940 --> 32:15.860
You certainly have a noble heart.

523
32:19.180 --> 32:19.460
No.

524
32:21.260 --> 32:22.060
It wasn't because

525
32:22.740 --> 32:23.580
I'm particularly noble.

526
32:26.580 --> 32:27.820
It's just that the woman's name

527
32:28.940 --> 32:30.740
sounded like the name of someone I love.

528
32:32.940 --> 32:34.820
Hearing that thug harassing the lady with that name,

529
32:35.940 --> 32:38.380
I just couldn't swallow my anger.

530
32:43.700 --> 32:45.100
Now that you're a eunuch,

531
32:46.140 --> 32:47.620
that's all in the past.

532
32:48.780 --> 32:49.260
Let it go.

533
32:50.180 --> 32:51.980
I imagine the woman you loved

534
32:52.540 --> 32:54.460
must have found someone else by now.

535
33:03.580 --> 33:04.900
Whether I'd become a eunuch or not,

536
33:07.300 --> 33:08.420
she already belonged to another man.

537
33:10.980 --> 33:11.940
The woman I love

538
33:13.540 --> 33:14.460
has always been

539
33:16.540 --> 33:17.820
of a different social standing than me.

540
33:27.540 --> 33:27.980
Wang Qing!

541
33:31.100 --> 33:31.580
Yes, my lord.

542
33:32.300 --> 33:33.420
Go to the Imperial Cuisine Service

543
33:33.980 --> 33:34.660
and tell them

544
33:35.780 --> 33:37.180
Liu Wenji won't be returning.

545
33:37.820 --> 33:38.180
Yes, my lord.

546
33:42.300 --> 33:47.220
(Hidden Talent and Virtue)

547
33:50.700 --> 33:52.460
You'll accompany me to serve at tomorrow's hunt.

548
34:01.700 --> 34:02.060
I...

549
34:02.660 --> 34:04.060
I'm deeply grateful for your promotion, Lord Yu!

550
34:12.460 --> 34:12.980
You may go.

551
34:16.060 --> 34:16.620
I'll take my leave.

552
34:16.940 --> 34:23.840
(Hidden Talent and Virtue)

553
34:44.940 --> 34:48.460
(30 Years Ago)

554
34:48.460 --> 34:49.500
(Luhua Hall) Go tell my brother, the Emperor,

555
34:49.860 --> 34:50.580
if he's going to keep me locked up here,

556
34:50.580 --> 34:51.700
I might as well be dead!

557
34:58.220 --> 34:58.860
Don't do it, Your Highness!

558
34:59.540 --> 35:00.180
Don't, Your Highness!

559
35:07.500 --> 35:10.860
(Mu Ningshuang, Young Grand Princess of Luling)

560
35:10.860 --> 35:11.300
Who are you?

561
35:11.700 --> 35:12.540
Why haven't I seen you before?

562
35:13.820 --> 35:14.940
I'm Yu Cheng'an, Your Highness.

563
35:15.740 --> 35:17.660
(Young Yu Cheng'an) I used to feed your horses.

564
35:18.420 --> 35:19.580
You wouldn't have seen me.

565
35:21.420 --> 35:22.180
Unbelievable!

566
35:23.140 --> 35:24.820
They promised to leave me someone to serve me,

567
35:25.100 --> 35:26.580
yet they sent me a stable boy!

568
35:27.220 --> 35:28.420
What do they take me for?

569
35:28.980 --> 35:30.260
I might as well be dead!

570
35:30.260 --> 35:31.180
Your Highness! Please!

571
35:31.420 --> 35:31.700
Your Highness!

572
35:32.380 --> 35:32.700
Your Highness!

573
35:35.540 --> 35:36.220
Are you stupid?

574
35:37.460 --> 35:37.940
You don't get it.

575
35:39.180 --> 35:39.740
If I'm going to make a scene,

576
35:39.980 --> 35:41.220
there needs to be some blood.

577
35:42.180 --> 35:43.460
Once my brother hears about it,

578
35:43.660 --> 35:44.700
he won't dare keep me locked up.

579
35:52.460 --> 35:53.340
Actually,

580
35:54.020 --> 35:54.980
maybe I should just kill you.

581
35:56.780 --> 35:57.420
That way,

582
35:57.860 --> 35:58.700
if someone ends up dead,

583
35:59.380 --> 36:00.500
my brother wouldn't possibly

584
36:00.500 --> 36:02.060
keep me locked up with a corpse.

585
36:02.820 --> 36:03.460
Don't you think?

586
36:19.660 --> 36:20.100
What a bore.

587
36:21.300 --> 36:22.380
I'm only a lowly servant.

588
36:22.740 --> 36:25.060
Better to hurt me than yourself, Your Highness.

589
36:29.100 --> 36:30.900
You really are an idiot.

590
36:32.100 --> 36:32.820
You thought I meant it?

591
36:36.980 --> 36:38.420
All those noblemen

592
36:38.940 --> 36:40.420
have beautiful women fawning over them.

593
36:41.620 --> 36:43.500
All I did was go to a music house

594
36:43.660 --> 36:45.460
and fool around with a few pretty-boy musicians.

595
36:46.260 --> 36:46.900
And look what happened.

596
36:47.660 --> 36:48.900
I ended up locked away like this.

597
36:50.220 --> 36:51.780
If I actually killed you,

598
36:52.460 --> 36:53.780
my self-righteous brother

599
36:54.060 --> 36:55.900
would probably send even more people to watch me.

600
36:56.540 --> 36:57.780
Then I'd never get out!

601
37:01.540 --> 37:02.420
Three months.

602
37:04.140 --> 37:06.180
I'll lose my mind being locked up that long!

603
37:07.100 --> 37:08.140
I'm sure you'll get through

604
37:08.620 --> 37:10.100
the three months safely, Your Highness.

605
37:10.980 --> 37:11.820
I may be clumsy,

606
37:12.380 --> 37:14.140
but I'll do everything I can to serve you.

607
37:33.700 --> 37:35.380
You can spit it into my hand, Your Highness.

608
37:38.500 --> 37:39.020
Stable boy,

609
37:39.780 --> 37:41.460
what did you say your name was again?

610
37:42.660 --> 37:43.980
Yu Cheng'an, Your Highness.

611
37:47.780 --> 37:49.900
Seeing that meek little face of yours every day,

612
37:51.140 --> 37:53.100
hearing "Your Highness" all day...

613
37:53.940 --> 37:55.420
I'm sick of hearing it!

614
37:59.140 --> 37:59.540
Yu Cheng'an,

615
38:00.900 --> 38:03.020
today, I'm allowing you to call me by my name.

616
38:04.420 --> 38:05.100
I wouldn't dare.

617
38:05.580 --> 38:06.980
You dare disobey my orders?

618
38:09.580 --> 38:11.980
But I don't even know your name, Your Highness.

619
38:15.020 --> 38:15.500
Ningshuang.

620
38:16.620 --> 38:18.180
My name is Mu Ningshuang.

621
38:18.780 --> 38:19.220
Go ahead. Say it.

622
38:26.420 --> 38:31.820
Mu... Ningshuang.

623
38:32.540 --> 38:33.140
Can you read?

624
38:35.260 --> 38:37.380
Then you surely haven't read Ruan Ji's poetry.

625
38:38.260 --> 38:38.620
No, I haven't.

626
38:40.460 --> 38:42.380
"Thick frost blankets the wild grass,

627
38:42.780 --> 38:44.860
as the year draws to its end."

628
38:48.420 --> 38:50.900
"Thick frost

629
38:51.340 --> 38:52.580
blankets the wild grass..."

630
38:55.540 --> 38:56.820
You wouldn't understand it anyway.

631
38:57.620 --> 38:58.500
Just remember,

632
38:58.940 --> 38:59.740
the wild grass

633
38:59.900 --> 39:02.260
means lowly people like you.

634
39:03.660 --> 39:04.580
I'll remember that.

635
39:08.940 --> 39:09.460
Stable boy,

636
39:11.260 --> 39:12.500
you've never tasted this before, have you?

637
39:48.420 --> 39:49.420
Three months...

638
39:51.940 --> 39:52.980
Three months...

639
39:54.060 --> 39:56.660
When is this misery going to end?

640
40:03.740 --> 40:04.220
Yu Cheng'an.

641
40:04.900 --> 40:05.660
Get over here!

642
40:06.900 --> 40:07.900
I'm bored out of my mind.

643
40:08.460 --> 40:10.180
How about I teach you to read?

644
40:15.660 --> 40:16.060
Sir.

645
40:25.540 --> 40:26.300
(Why did Yu Cheng'an)

646
40:27.020 --> 40:28.860
(specifically ask about Chunhua?)

647
40:31.220 --> 40:33.260
(Why is he so concerned about her unborn child?)

648
40:34.460 --> 40:35.860
(And he even mentioned the Crown Prince.)

649
40:38.700 --> 40:39.820
(What does any of this)

650
40:40.660 --> 40:42.060
(have to do with the Crown Prince?)

651
40:48.340 --> 40:49.460
Mr. Liu

652
40:49.580 --> 40:50.820
certainly has a way with words.

653
40:51.540 --> 40:53.020
No wonder he's caught your eye.

654
40:55.140 --> 40:55.980
But...

655
40:56.500 --> 40:57.900
he overheard our conversation.

656
40:58.660 --> 40:59.300
Won't that be a problem?

657
40:59.660 --> 41:00.060
Not at all.

658
41:01.540 --> 41:03.140
From the start of tomorrow's winter hunt

659
41:03.620 --> 41:04.340
until it ends,

660
41:04.980 --> 41:06.780
I won't let him out of my sight.

661
41:07.420 --> 41:08.100
Besides,

662
41:09.100 --> 41:11.980
with every faction vying for power, we need capable people.

663
41:12.340 --> 41:13.060
I believe

664
41:14.140 --> 41:16.500
he has real potential.

665
41:19.340 --> 41:21.580
Losing Mr. Zheng was like losing your right hand.

666
41:22.460 --> 41:23.380
Someone needs

667
41:24.140 --> 41:25.740
to fill the void he left.

668
41:27.060 --> 41:30.020
(Wangchun Wine)

669
41:45.500 --> 41:46.620
What brings you here, Your Royal Highness?

670
41:49.820 --> 41:50.420
I came to see you.

671
41:52.380 --> 41:54.020
Your Royal Highness gracing such a humble place?

672
41:54.420 --> 41:55.340
I'm hardly worthy of the honor.

673
41:57.540 --> 41:58.540
I looked into it for you.

674
41:58.940 --> 42:00.060
What Meng Zaishi said

675
42:01.020 --> 42:01.620
was true.

676
42:05.660 --> 42:06.740
Is there anything else you need?

677
42:07.500 --> 42:08.620
Just give me your orders.

678
42:24.100 --> 42:24.740
Put your boots on.

679
42:25.580 --> 42:26.340
I'm taking you somewhere.

680
42:28.860 --> 42:29.620
There are things

681
42:30.660 --> 42:31.740
I've kept from you all this time.

682
42:32.420 --> 42:33.020
But I promise,

683
42:34.020 --> 42:34.700
after tonight,

684
42:35.580 --> 42:36.620
I won't hide anything from you again.

685
42:39.820 --> 42:40.220
Yang Si,

686
42:41.740 --> 42:42.260
come with me.

687
42:51.420 --> 42:53.100
What are we doing here so late?

688
42:54.020 --> 42:55.460
We've already kept our special guest waiting long enough.

689
42:56.180 --> 42:56.660
Special guest?

690
43:21.780 --> 43:24.500
Tomorrow's weather looks perfect for hunting.

691
43:33.820 --> 43:34.660
Don't worry.

692
43:35.620 --> 43:37.820
I've rarely missed my target since I was little.

693
43:38.580 --> 43:39.420
I'm really good, you know.

694
43:43.820 --> 43:44.300
I know.

695
43:45.260 --> 43:46.180
You're very good.

696
43:47.740 --> 43:49.740
I might not be able to keep up with you on horseback tomorrow.

697
43:50.140 --> 43:51.380
Why would you need to keep up with me?

698
43:52.540 --> 43:53.420
Weapons are dangerous.

699
43:53.740 --> 43:54.980
I won't have time to protect you.

700
43:55.980 --> 43:56.900
Tomorrow,

701
43:57.700 --> 43:59.220
you stay in the rest tent

702
44:00.060 --> 44:00.700
and wait for my triumphant return.

703
44:02.980 --> 44:03.500
Wanyao,

704
44:04.820 --> 44:05.700
besides you,

705
44:06.780 --> 44:08.300
if the Crown Prince,

706
44:08.660 --> 44:10.220
Yang Si, or Zhao Lingfei claims the deer,

707
44:10.700 --> 44:11.740
things might still turn out well.

708
44:12.980 --> 44:13.500
But if the deer

709
44:14.380 --> 44:15.180
ends up in the hands of

710
44:16.300 --> 44:17.940
Qiu Shuo or Mu Xianqing,

711
44:18.900 --> 44:20.540
it may be no better than Meng Zaishi winning.

712
44:22.380 --> 44:23.460
At best, the odds

713
44:23.980 --> 44:25.140
are four to three in our favor.

714
44:27.420 --> 44:28.820
And that's being optimistic.

715
44:30.340 --> 44:31.300
In this gamble,

716
44:32.300 --> 44:33.940
all seven of us want different things,

717
44:34.780 --> 44:36.100
and none of us is guaranteed to get what we want.

718
44:37.940 --> 44:38.900
The only one running the game

719
44:39.740 --> 44:40.860
is the man who releases the deer.

720
44:46.780 --> 44:48.060
But maybe that's a good thing.

721
44:48.980 --> 44:50.460
To him, I'm no more than an insect.

722
44:51.220 --> 44:52.540
With such a grand event tomorrow,

723
44:53.340 --> 44:54.740
he'll have bigger things on his mind.

724
44:55.900 --> 44:58.140
He won't go out of his way to target me.

725
44:59.820 --> 45:01.100
Please be very careful tomorrow.

726
45:02.980 --> 45:05.500
♪As if our love will never fade♪

727
45:05.500 --> 45:06.740
Tomorrow isn't even here yet,

728
45:07.780 --> 45:09.060
and you're already worrying yourself sick.

729
45:10.580 --> 45:11.780
Haven't you heard

730
45:12.100 --> 45:13.460
the saying

731
45:13.460 --> 45:15.820
that every moment of a night like this is precious?

732
45:22.140 --> 45:26.780
(Next Episode Preview)

733
45:27.460 --> 45:28.500
Your Highness,

734
45:29.100 --> 45:29.940
sooner or later,

735
45:30.780 --> 45:32.300
I'll make you look at me the way you used to,

736
45:33.420 --> 45:35.100
with tenderness in your eyes,

737
45:36.140 --> 45:36.900
begging me.

738
45:39.700 --> 45:40.580
Just you wait.

739
45:43.441 --> 45:46.734
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

740
45:49.419 --> 45:54.335
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

741
45:56.529 --> 46:02.374
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

742
46:02.874 --> 46:08.100
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

743
46:10.869 --> 46:15.660
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

744
46:16.496 --> 46:22.575
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

745
46:24.376 --> 46:27.526
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

746
46:27.526 --> 46:29.174
♪Burning bright as a song♪

747
46:29.226 --> 46:32.950
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

748
46:33.328 --> 46:37.994
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

749
46:38.613 --> 46:42.654
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

750
46:43.145 --> 46:45.260
♪Not a single hour less♪

751
46:45.300 --> 46:52.246
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

752
46:53.009 --> 46:56.462
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

753
46:56.642 --> 46:59.787
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

754
47:00.226 --> 47:06.863
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

755
47:07.260 --> 47:09.298
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

756
47:09.298 --> 47:11.774
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

757
47:11.812 --> 47:14.281
♪You're the only one I need♪

758
47:14.485 --> 47:21.372
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

759
47:21.684 --> 47:24.955
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

760
47:25.260 --> 47:28.433
♪My last untouched innocence♪

761
47:28.757 --> 47:32.183
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

762
47:32.416 --> 47:35.641
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

763
47:35.972 --> 47:42.768
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

764
47:43.137 --> 47:45.199
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

765
47:45.200 --> 47:47.703
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

766
47:47.750 --> 47:50.088
♪You're the only one I need♪

767
47:50.319 --> 47:57.154
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

768
47:57.503 --> 47:59.121
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

769
47:59.251 --> 48:01.047
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

770
48:01.404 --> 48:04.421
♪You're the only one I need♪

771
48:04.461 --> 48:05.788
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
